OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F358A1785383027
OL,3,CFormer England captain elected to
OL,4,Cpolitics
OL,6,FFormer England netball captain Serena
OL,7,FKersten Guthrie has been elected as
OL,8,Fone of Jersey's nine Senators.
OL,10,FHer international playing career
OL,11,Fspanned more than a decade, and she
OL,12,Fwas voted Jersey Sportsperson of the
OL,13,FYear in 2014.
OL,15,FNow, the Commonwealth Games gold
OL,16,Fmedallist is turning her attention to
OL,17,Fthe political arena.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/8
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
