FL,359,380,250,120,000,100
PN,35802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F358A1785383027
OL,3,CFormer England captain elected to
OL,4,Cpolitics
OL,6,FSpeaking to ITV Channel, Senator-Elect
OL,7,FKersten Guthrie says she is "massively
OL,8,Fhumbled" and compared her newfound
OL,9,Fpolitical success with her well-
OL,10,Fdocumented sporting accomplishments.
OL,12,FShe adds: "I probably put this up
OL,13,Fthere with playing for England. It's
OL,14,Fan incredible privilege to lead in
OL,15,Fthis way for an island that I
OL,16,Fabsolutely love."
OL,18,FThe Senator-Elect wants to prove to
OL,19,Fyoung people that they should not feel
OL,20,Fboxed in, but flexible and open to new
OL,21,Favenues.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/8
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBCh Is Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,359,380,250,120,000,100
PN,35803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F358A1785383027
OL,3,CFormer England captain elected to
OL,4,Cpolitics
OL,6,FShe explains: "You can change
OL,7,Fdirection in your career, you can
OL,8,Fpivot and go and do something else.
OL,10,F"I never thought I'd be doing this in
OL,11,Fmy entire life, but I also never
OL,12,Fthought I'd be captaining England and
OL,13,Fwinning gold medals, but here I am."
OL,15,FSenator-Elect Kersten Guthrie is
OL,16,Fcelebrating her return to a high-
OL,17,Fpressure environment, expressing
OL,18,Fexcitement for the challenge.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/8
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
