OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F358A1785383027
OL,3,CFormer England captain elected to
OL,4,Cpolitics
OL,6,FAsked about the emphasis she has
OL,7,Fplaced upon teamwork in her manifesto,
OL,8,Fshe says: "I want to be able to work
OL,9,Fwith people to understand the value of
OL,10,Fhow working with others can achieve
OL,11,Fgreat things.
OL,13,F"You've got 49 brains in there (the
OL,14,FState Assembly). That is always going
OL,15,Fto be better than one, and one person
OL,16,Ftaking all the weight on their
OL,17,Fshoulders.
OL,26,@uD@`pmvD@Opn
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/8
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBCh Is Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,359,380,250,120,000,100
PN,35805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F358A1785383027
OL,3,CFormer England captain elected to
OL,4,Cpolitics
OL,6,F"The complex issues we have in Jersey
OL,7,Fat the moment are really
OL,8,Finterconnected, so we're going to need
OL,9,Fto leverage absolutely everything we
OL,10,Fhave.
OL,12,F"Teamwork can be at the forefront of
OL,13,Fgetting the island back on track."
OL,15,FThe former England captain adds she
OL,16,Fwould love to become the next Sports
OL,17,FMinister, but would also be interested
OL,18,Fin expanding this into a position
OL,19,Fworking as Minister for Sports and
OL,20,FCommunities.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G5/8
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
