CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F358A1785383027
OL,3,CFormer England captain elected to
OL,4,Cpolitics
OL,6,FDeputy-Elect Kersten Guthrie explains:
OL,7,F"The charitable sector is deep in need
OL,8,Fof more advocacy, and maybe a Minister
OL,9,Fto be that person to represent them."
OL,11,FAll four female candidates for Senator
OL,12,Fwere successful in their campaigns -
OL,13,Fsomething she says is an important
OL,14,Fstep forward.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G6/8
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
