CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F358A1785383027
OL,3,CFormer England captain elected to
OL,4,Cpolitics
OL,6,FShe adds: "It's huge ... You need
OL,7,Fbalance, it's about representation.
OL,8,FI'm a true believer that if we want to
OL,9,Fcreate robust policies and legislation
OL,10,Fthat is sustainable, you need
OL,11,Fdifferent views, and people in the
OL,12,Froom to be able to do that."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G7/8
